{"id": "69364", "title": "年轻的脖子", "author": "咬", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 43, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/69/69364.htm", "intro": "他觉得秦淮最美的地方就是这里。年轻女孩纤细白皙的脖子，比过她们两条光溜的小腿还要娇嫩柔美；它是半透明的，阳光从侧面照过来似乎可以看到皮肤下细小的血管，可以清晰地触碰到那汩汩的血液。\r\n 每当他挑开她的衣领看到这一幕，他觉得他可以双手奉上自己的生命，只为轻轻触碰那跳动着的生命。", "base": "files/article/html/69/69364", "chapters": [{"title": "沧州", "file": "10616000.html", "available": false}, {"title": "初逢", "file": "10616001.html", "available": false}, {"title": "春沉", "file": "10616002.html", "available": false}, {"title": "父子", "file": "10616003.html", "available": false}, {"title": "烦心", "file": "10616004.html", "available": false}, {"title": "躁动", "file": "10616005.html", "available": false}, {"title": "长夜", "file": "10616006.html", "available": false}, {"title": "冷静", "file": "10616007.html", "available": false}, {"title": "生日", "file": "10616008.html", "available": false}, {"title": "残存", "file": "10616009.html", "available": false}, {"title": "对面", "file": "10616010.html", "available": false}, {"title": "思慕时", "file": "10616011.html", "available": false}, {"title": "平地起", "file": "10616012.html", "available": false}, {"title": "罘罳", "file": "10616013.html", "available": false}, {"title": "两心", "file": "10616014.html", "available": false}, {"title": "欢喜", "file": "10616015.html", "available": false}, {"title": "渐离", "file": "10616016.html", "available": false}, {"title": "破阵子", "file": "10616017.html", "available": false}, {"title": "归去来", "file": "10616018.html", "available": false}, {"title": "朝中措", "file": "10616019.html", "available": false}, {"title": "两同心", "file": "10616020.html", "available": false}, {"title": "叨叨令", "file": "10616021.html", "available": false}, {"title": "鸟鸣涧", "file": "10616022.html", "available": false}, {"title": "行路难", "file": "10616023.html", "available": false}, {"title": "一枝春", "file": "10616024.html", "available": false}, {"title": "女娇娥", "file": "10616025.html", "available": false},